m/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_27292244040449194_3509206164409486334_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yK7VgmPEeB0Q7kNvwHdgLyI&_nc_oc=Adr_CMj6pURO5rVfehhMYAjvlGzvGc3ePJYlW_P-_GzSiLy6irmVG2lPX-EMDdicArU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSL5Iqmaon33LCZackv9t0eJ3maZ7ghhjNoAF1OQmIORQ&oe=6B030333"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots01.png", "id": "1109337971748811", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1109337975082144_2868233776751948265_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5W_K2SAD6IcQ7kNvwGEJgJ3&_nc_oc=AdrcYE-Zz9sanu17TvvPbMCJnTzXBGHvlJGfD9cdDxujq-g9lERgfOR9ZS_5aqYq9Ms&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxXPzww6JdOw8qz08DaF6TRXv3g6gmkeRQ-TmJocmZtg&oe=6B03320B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots07.png", "id": "1384542647199119", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1384542650532452_1440589814285122188_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-2rbR3p_eEQ7kNvwHfqOWC&_nc_oc=AdqMYKH_W-SkAYteVrwOORebVs6hGIzh61DCLCWk_SJ6VPt4axSPWHTW11ls472PcY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQREMuuRAiKLdKjvCQNyAXIcQ-wHHP9EJpPQ2Pt10tfLGA&oe=6B030C84"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots02.png", "id": "1400532592047808", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_1400532595381141_3399314511837708075_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=elzry_hEQukQ7kNvwEzPKn2&_nc_oc=AdpoMYYGVno0r61hkN-MyxQG0b9IHJiUY8Q9vSyvlAF8kA1nHluIHmBQ8r2P7cMXKNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0ynFdwqFG1ByQxx7zSkyYlnU2O689N618K6f8CwWyfQ&oe=6B0310D6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_s logom.png", "id": "985519041223669", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_985519044557002_3272235211507795905_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-QShvs3NUs8Q7kNvwEKmG5e&_nc_oc=AdolAeVEp3qm4KrYUFOapoTWAUcLjnp2EoAKA_eR9BqUzqJUqhHUsQ7Bnxwkor_Nsc8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcC2WvNOFFhteQw5lDusVdrA_iMC6xsJNNux273GPV_A&oe=6B031850"}, "display_name": "Control Freek", "keywords": ["Reflex", "Speed", "Buttons", "Challenge", "Time"], "long_description": "# OPERATORS WANTED!\n\nWe are looking for new hands to join the assembling team of the HAPPY ITEMS CORPORATION (HI-CORP\u00ae) and race for maximum effectivity!\n\nYour task will be to control the HI-Console\u00ae and keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running. In other words: Press. Flick. Push. Pull. Levers. Cranks. Buttons. Switches.\n\nExecute each sequence in the correct and timely order to manufacture a certified HAPPY ITEM\u00ae. Successful completion resets the line: an infinite loop of productivity, purpose, and joy!\n\nYour duties:\n- Master increasingly complex variations of the HI-Console\u00ae controls\n- Outperform your Co-Operators on the global leaderboards and become Operator of the Month\n- Share one headset in Party Mode: colleagues, relatives and houseguests take turns at the HI-Console\u00ae, and every level keeps a local leaderboard so they can be ranked, compared, judged and thus motivated to improve\n- Operate to the sound of our tailor-composed HI-CORP\u00ae soundtrack, engineered for maximum joy\n- Most importantly: always have fun!\n\nAre you ready to push some levers and limits?\n\nHI-CORP\u00ae\nHuman Resource & Joy Management\n", "short_description": "Junior Operators wanted! Master the HI-Console\u00ae!\n\nA VR arcade game of pulling, flicking, and pressing analogue controls\nin fast, precise sequences to keep the HI-CORP\u00ae production line running.\n\nSpeed up, skill up and become Operator of the Month!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fono-labs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/contro